     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, Jan 22, 2020, 5:02 AM Terrence Jorgensen &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tjorge...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
